{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1494746-mockery-breed-character-sheets","id":1494746,"title":"Mockery Breed Character Sheets?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-10-10T12:48:30-07:00","id":1494746,"title":"Mockery Breed Character Sheets?","content":"Hi everyone! I was going through my backlog of character sheet requests, and I found a request to make character sheets for the Mockery Breeds for W20.<br /> <br /> I looked in the W20 Book of the Wyrm, and there is a bit of info, but I have a few questions so I thought I'd ask here.<br /> <br /> 1) Do you think these breeds need any kind of Renown or anything like that?<br /> <br /> 2) I assume they get the typical Rage and Gnosis, but do they need any other kind of power stat?<br /> <br /> 3) Does anyone have some suggestions for images I should use for the form stats? If you want to send me some links or something that'd be awesome.<br /> <br /> 4) Is there anything you think I should include on these sheets aside from the typical options I have on the W20 sheets?<br /> <br /> Thanks in advance for the help!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-13T00:59:39-07:00","id":1494912,"title":"","content":"Mockery Breeds will have Rage and Gnosis unless otherwise stated.<br /> <br /> Mockery Breeds don't have any Renown to speak of unless one of the following happen; they become part of Gaia (a huge deal which would be earthshaking, and require great wisdom and hard work from forward-thinking Garou/Fera) or they fully surrender to the Wyrm and gain Renown through service to its third of reality; note that most corrupted beings are not fully turned over to act as puppets or direct servants, it's a big deal. Yeren are noted to have their own way of gaining Renown, though it's not formalized, it just mentions the kind of things that gain them renown.<br /> <br /> Generally speaking a Mockery will be stuck using only level 1 gifts, they have the potential to contain more but the spirit world does not respect, like or trust them. Even Yeren advance slowly, and they're as close as a Mockery Breed gets to being respected in the Wyrmish world - note that in Book of the Wyrm they have level 2 and 3 gifts, which is incredible, but no level 4 or 5 gifts. Samsa can learn Gifts from Cockroach and his Brood, but given that they are stuck at rank '0' they can only learn level 1 gifts.<br /> <br /> No idea for images, sorry!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11620,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11620-twig","user":"twig","date":". 10-13-2022, 04:02 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11620-twig","name":"twig","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11620_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4568"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-14T06:24:18-07:00","id":1494967,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>11twiggins</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1494746-mockery-breed-character-sheets?p=1494912#post1494912\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Mockery Breeds will have Rage and Gnosis unless otherwise stated.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks! I had a feeling, but thought I'd double check.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>11twiggins</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1494746-mockery-breed-character-sheets?p=1494912#post1494912\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Mockery Breeds don't have any Renown to speak of unless one of the following happen; they become part of Gaia (a huge deal which would be earthshaking, and require great wisdom and hard work from forward-thinking Garou/Fera) or they fully surrender to the Wyrm and gain Renown through service to its third of reality; note that most corrupted beings are not fully turned over to act as puppets or direct servants, it's a big deal. Yeren are noted to have their own way of gaining Renown, though it's not formalized, it just mentions the kind of things that gain them renown.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hmm....well, sounds like at least for now, best to leave Renown off and use that space for something else. Just have to figure out what...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>11twiggins</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1494746-mockery-breed-character-sheets?p=1494912#post1494912\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Generally speaking a Mockery will be stuck using only level 1 gifts, they have the potential to contain more but the spirit world does not respect, like or trust them. Even Yeren advance slowly, and they're as close as a Mockery Breed gets to being respected in the Wyrmish world - note that in Book of the Wyrm they have level 2 and 3 gifts, which is incredible, but no level 4 or 5 gifts. Samsa can learn Gifts from Cockroach and his Brood, but given that they are stuck at rank '0' they can only learn level 1 gifts.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah, thanks for the info! I appreciate it.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>11twiggins</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1494746-mockery-breed-character-sheets?p=1494912#post1494912\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">No idea for images, sorry!</div> </div> </div> </div>That's ok. If no one else has any suggestions, I'll start googling and see what I can come up with...<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-21T10:14:12-07:00","id":1495359,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11620-twig\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar11620_5.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"11620\" data-vbnamecard=\"11620\">twig</a> I've got another question about Mockery Breeds. Do you think they'd have need for any Rites or Fetishes? I'm gearing up to start on the sheet, so I wondered if they need space for those...<br /> <br /> Thanks in advance!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-21T11:00:46-07:00","id":1495361,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1494746-mockery-breed-character-sheets?p=1495359#post1495359\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11620-twig\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar11620_5.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"11620\" data-vbnamecard=\"11620\">twig</a> I've got another question about Mockery Breeds. Do you think they'd have need for any Rites or Fetishes? I'm gearing up to start on the sheet, so I wondered if they need space for those...<br /> <br /> Thanks in advance!</div> </div> </div> </div>Wereapes have one Rite that we know of, in which they &quot;Pass Over The Shadow Of The Ape&quot;, it is a rite which turns an adult human (a sociopathic lawyer, businessman, banker etc.) into one of them. The other Mockery Breeds don't have any Rites that we know of. This is because Rites are a special connection between Garou/Fera/Ananasi and the spirit world, a pact. If you do the rite correctly the spiritual laws of reality just bend to make something happen. This privilege is unique to groups who are recognized by the spirit world.<br /> <br /> Technically any Mockery, such as a Samsa runaway, could have a Fetish in their possession, but it's very abnormal. I'd wager the only Mockeries who possess Fetishes with any regularity are, again, the Wereapes, as they are fast becoming the up-and-comers in Pentex. This gives them opportunities to purchase/steal/acquire Fetishes in ways others can't.<br /> <br /> Basically with these sheets you do run into the fact that only the most recent creation, the Yeren, are an approximation of a regular Werebeast. Most of them will have very sparse sheets. And honestly that's fine - if you wanted to play a fully realized changing breed there are tones of options!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11620-twig","name":"twig","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11620_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4568"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-21T13:03:38-07:00","id":1495366,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>11twiggins</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1494746-mockery-breed-character-sheets?p=1495361#post1495361\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Wereapes have one Rite that we know of, in which they &quot;Pass Over The Shadow Of The Ape&quot;, it is a rite which turns an adult human (a sociopathic lawyer, businessman, banker etc.) into one of them. The other Mockery Breeds don't have any Rites that we know of. This is because Rites are a special connection between Garou/Fera/Ananasi and the spirit world, a pact. If you do the rite correctly the spiritual laws of reality just bend to make something happen. This privilege is unique to groups who are recognized by the spirit world.<br /> <br /> Technically any Mockery, such as a Samsa runaway, could have a Fetish in their possession, but it's very abnormal. I'd wager the only Mockeries who possess Fetishes with any regularity are, again, the Wereapes, as they are fast becoming the up-and-comers in Pentex. This gives them opportunities to purchase/steal/acquire Fetishes in ways others can't.<br /> <br /> Basically with these sheets you do run into the fact that only the most recent creation, the Yeren, are an approximation of a regular Werebeast. Most of them will have very sparse sheets. And honestly that's fine - if you wanted to play a fully realized changing breed there are tones of options!</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah... ok. Thank you for all the info! I wasn't sure they needed rites or fetishes, as I was pretty sure that was more spiritual related stuff, but I figured I should asked before I got started.<br /> <br /> I really appreciate the info and the help! I'll see what I came up in to fill in some of those spaces. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-07T07:30:51-08:00","id":1496396,"title":"","content":"HI everyone! I have the Mockery Breed sheets finished now! I found some form pictures to use and <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/780-torakhan\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar780_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"780\" data-vbnamecard=\"780\">Torakhan</a> helped me with the logos and symbols. I think think they turned out pretty good!<br /> <br /> Hope you like em!<br /> <br /> You can download them from my site in the W20 section here: <a href=\"https://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/wod.html#w20\" target=\"_blank\">https://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/wod.html#w20</a><br /> <br /> <br /> Here are some direct links should you need them:<br /> <br /> <br /> 2-Page Sheets:<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pdf/W20/W20_2-Page_MockeryBreeds_Anurana_Interactive.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pdf/W20/W20_2-Page_MockeryBreeds_Anurana_Interactive.pdf\" target=\"